    (instances
      (project "cell_test_bench"
        (path "/2ca2ea37-9df4-44c4-a178-bea9b66a1bc2/02040192-ced7-4385-89e1-29754c8d0505"
          (reference "#PWR030")
          (unit 1)))))
  (text "Single 10 mOhm 4-terminal shunt R201 (Ohmite LVK25, 2 W) sits in the cell negative lead, so it measures BOTH charge and discharge current. System GND = shunt ground side (star point)."
    (at 25 178.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 8594f831-7235-4402-b9d3-5e92a144c284))
  (text "Kelvin sense: ISNS_N / ISNS_G from the shunt sense pads, SENSE_P / SENSE_N from separate wires at the cell tabs (J206)."
    (at 25 182.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 90e51090-e3ad-4cb0-8b5c-d8250d2e1e09))
  (text "K1 (charger) and K2 (load): Panasonic ALFG2PF121 PCB power relays, 12 V coil, 33 A, normally open."
    (at 25 187.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid d5cc23b7-940c-450c-9bd8-55702e706d4b))
  (text "Interlock: Q203 holds K1 off while K2_EN is high, Q204 holds K2 off while K1_EN is high (both commanded = both off). Q205/Q206 drop both relays on FAULT."
    (at 25 191.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 2ad1c161-2dda-4bcd-838b-9b1c0e953bd3))
  (text "R204/R207 pull-downs keep both relays off while the MCU boots. Q201/Q202: BS170 (TO-92) coil drivers, coil ~150 mA."
    (at 25 196.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 7efc7124-1739-4ab0-a131-498cdbc64694))  (text "v0.3 REVIEW NOTES - explained in docs/SCHEMATIC_GUIDE.md section 2; checklist with comment columns in docs/SCHEMATIC_REVIEW.md"
    (at 25 205.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5) bold)
      (justify left top))
    (uuid e2f3f8d8-ccf2-4571-98f6-410c0dd95926))
  (text "How it works: R201 (10 mOhm, pins 1/4 = current, 2/3 = Kelvin sense) is in the cell negative lead, so it sees charge AND discharge."
    (at 25 210.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 48b06f4d-6436-44db-b415-1256c38fa5bf))
  (text "GND is defined at R201 pin 4. Discharge: ISNS_N negative vs ISNS_G. Charge: ISNS_N positive. Relay coils 117 mA, 1.4 W (ALFG2PF121)."
    (at 25 214.5 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid 2c8b0b33-573c-4dc4-a30d-be59cd8cc995))
  (text "CHECK R-02: BS170 at 3.3 V gate for 117 mA.  R-04: LVK25 pin numbering vs Ohmite drawing.  F-01: coil pads are 0.5 mm slots (not CNC-drillable)."
    (at 25 219.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid ea5dcf6b-5dfc-4e7c-bfdf-92d272e275fb))
)
